itions, including heart or back problems, is prohibited from participating.<br>\n🏋️‍♂️ The activity is suitable for participants of all physical fitness levels.<br>\n👫 Children 13 years and under must be accompanied by an adult.<br>\n💰 Any changes made after booking may incur a £25.00 admin fee.<br>\n⏰ If the selected time is not available, your booking will be scheduled for the nearest available time, and you will be informed by Thames RIB Experience 24 hours before your booking date. Similarly, if your trip is affected by our Minimum Passenger Number Policy, you will be contacted 24 hours before to arrange an alternative time or date.<br>\n&nbsp;\n<hr><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><strong>Why choose Fever?</strong></span><br>\n✔️ Millions of users book every month.<br>\n✔️ The best prices and availability at all times.<br>\n✔️ Thousands of unique experiences.<br>\n✔️ Verified user reviews.<br>\n✔️ 24/7 customer service.<br>\n&nbsp;\n<hr> <em>Experience supplied by Thames Rib Experience</em><br>",
